					<p><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-37329" src="/wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular.jpg" alt="Todays custom water features have long surpassed tabletop fountains and are Esther Williams-worth creations. Some that are over 30-foot installations of water cascading over the glass to choreographed bubble walls with color-changing LED lights. Midwest Tropical provides water walls whose customization is only limited by your imagination. They are available in all sizes, materials, and shapes, including granite slabs and mosaic glass tiles. If youre contemplating custom water walls, then by the end, youll have made up your mind, so continue reading to find out why theyre the trendiest human creation of the century. 1. Create a personalized architectural statement Theres only so much that wall murals and decoration pieces can do when trying to make a statement. With a custom wall waterfall that is tailored to your theme, you can create a personal statement that reflects on your working style and leaves an imprint that people are not likely to forget. 2. Elite styles Water wall features offer you a chance to establish an elite style with convenience. Whether its made of glass or granite slabs, you can go modern-chic or urban that blends well with the rest of your decor. 3. Adorn empty spaces and long corridors Filling up empty spaces can be daunting when choosing what goes where. Instead of shopping around for pieces that will grow old soon, invest in a water wall that will not only fill the space but create a focal point that attracts people no matter how many times theyve seen it. With just this one piece, you can ensure that every corner of your commercial space sparks interest. 4. Visual Aesthetics Theres no denying the allure of custom water features, but the value they bring to the aesthetics is incomparable to all others. Midwest Tropicals water features give you the opportunity to enhance 